  "body": "I run a synapse server, and use web and android client to login, at first it works well. But sometime(after about many hours) the all the clients cant connect the server. The network is confirmed OK. In the log file the logs  like below:\r\n\r\n2017-02-09 20:33:57,628 - synapse.handlers.presence - 328 - INFO - - Handling presence timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:33:57,684 - synapse.storage.TIME - 207 - INFO - - Total database time: 0.000% {who_forgot(0): 0.000%, user_get_threepids(0): 0.000%, update_presence(0): 0.000%} {}\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:01,436 - synapse.metrics - 162 - INFO - - Collecting gc 0\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:02,627 - synapse.handlers.typing - 79 - INFO - - Checking for typing timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:02,628 - synapse.handlers.presence - 328 - INFO - - Handling presence timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:07,627 - synapse.handlers.typing - 79 - INFO - - Checking for typing timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:07,628 - synapse.handlers.presence - 328 - INFO - - Handling presence timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:07,684 - synapse.storage.TIME - 207 - INFO - - Total database time: 0.000% {who_forgot(0): 0.000%, user_get_threepids(0): 0.000%, update_presence(0): 0.000%} {}\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:12,627 - synapse.handlers.typing - 79 - INFO - - Checking for typing timeouts\r\n2017-02-09 20:34:12,628 - synapse.handlers.presence - 328 - INFO - - Handling presence timeouts\r\n\r\nSo, what happens? How can I debug to check the reasons?\r\n\r\n\r\n",
